      "issue_id": "billing-price-paywall",
      "reviews": [
        {
          "review_id": "23549579-2f77-4719-a3de-046960c764ca",
          "excerpt": "The payment has went up to $10.99¢ it was $9.99 monthly. Why is everything going up we are trying to make a living in this expensive world with our low payment job and on top of that COVID is still going around. I'm this close losing my apartment and now I have to cancel my Spotify payment and still my bank account is suffering from this messed up county we are in. Why is our payment membership so high, what was the reason!?!?",
          "excerpt_only": false,
          "topic": "billing",
          "intent": "cancellation",
          "severity": 5
        },
        {
          "review_id": "46c59423-983c-4799-ad94-b3c4e3a5d261",
          "excerpt": "تطبيق سئ وغير نافع مستهلكين أموال الناس فقط اعلانات كتير لازم تدفع فلوس مش بقدر توقف الاغنيه غير لما تشترك معاهم لازم تدفع عشان تسمع اغاني معنيه التطبيق يتجسس عليك من خلال الصلاحيات اللي بيطلبها منك لا انصح بتنزيله ابدا",
          "excerpt_only": false,
          "topic": "billing",
          "intent": "complaint",
          "severity": 5
        },
        {
